     1,
     "<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">Dear all, I am trying to run a multiple group path analysis (all variables are observed variables) in lavaan for a moderated mediation model. IV, DV and moderator are dichotomous, the mediator is continuous. I provide example data / the code below. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">My questions: <br>\r\n(overarching:) Is the model syntax correct? </p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">Particularly the interaction; does it work like this for two dichotomous variables as well?</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">Is using DWLS correct?</li></ol>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">Any pointers to literature that answers my questions, or direct replies are very much appreciated! Thanks for your time,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">Sophie</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:15px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:15px\">------</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">set.seed(123)<br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br>###sample data<br>n &lt;- 1000<br><br>group &lt;- rbinom(n, 1, prob = 0.45)<br>IV &lt;- rbinom(n, 1, prob = 0.5)<br>mod &lt;- rbinom(n, 1, prob = 0.4)<br><br>med &lt;- rnorm(n, mean = 10 + 5 * IV, sd = 3)<br>med &lt;- pmin(pmax(med, 0), 20)  <br><br>logit_DV &lt;- -5 + 0.3 * med + 0.1 * mod<br>prob_DV &lt;- 1 / (1 + exp(-logit_DV))  <br>DV &lt;- rbinom(n, 1, prob = prob_DV)<br><br>df &lt;- data.frame(group, IV, mod, med, DV)<br><br>###path model<br>library(lavaan)</p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br>simmodel_wi &lt;- &#39;<br>  med ~ c(a1g1, a1g2)*IV + c(a2g1, a2g2)*mod + c(a3g1, a3g2)*IV:mod<br>  <br>  DV ~ c(c1g1, c1g2)*IV + c(b1g1, b1g2)*med + c(c3g1, c3g2)*mod + c(c4g1, c4g2)*IV:mod<br><br>  #indirect effects<br>  ind_g1 := a1g1 * b1g1<br>  ind_g2 := a1g2 * b1g2<br>  <br>  #direct effects<br>  direct_g1 := c1g1<br>  direct_g2 := c1g2<br><br>  #total effects<br>  total_g1 := direct_g1 + ind_g1<br>  total_g2 := direct_g2 + ind_g2<br>&#39;<br><br>fit_simmodel_wi &lt;- sem(simmodel_wi, df, group = &quot;group&quot;, ordered = &quot;DV&quot;, estimator = &quot;DWLS&quot;, link = &quot;probit&quot;, se = &quot;bootstrap&quot;, bootstrap = 1000)<br>summary(fit_simmodel_wi, fit.measures = TRUE, standardize = TRUE, rsquare=TRUE, estimates = TRUE, ci = TRUE)<br></p>"
    ]
